    "setupNotes": [
      "Official 2.1.24 Space Age; 7 oil refineries (advanced oil processing) and 11 chemical plants (6 light-oil cracking, 2 heavy-oil cracking, sulfur, sulfuric acid, lubricant), 2 storage tanks, 2 pumps, no modules, 3 substations. WEST: water 12,880/min (pipe, top row of the west edge), crude oil 8,400/min (pipe, second row from the bottom), iron plates 10/min (red belt, bottom row). EAST: petroleum gas 7,140/min (pipe), sulfuric acid 500/min (pipe), sulfur 15/min (red belt, bottom row). NORTH: lubricant 150/min (pipe) and light oil (pipe; undrawn in normal use, up to 660/min, each 3 drawn costs 2 gas). Cracking follows the two tanks: heavy oil is cracked only while the heavy tank holds more than 10,000, light oil only while the light tank holds more than 10,000; keep the red wires and the pump conditions. Every second refinery is mirrored; keep the pipe-to-ground pairs. Supply electricity at any substation.",
      "The two fluid entrances on the west edge are 9 rows apart and the iron belt is on the bottom row, so plain pipes and a belt can be brought straight in. The light-oil and lubricant outlets are on the north edge; gas, acid and sulfur leave east."
    ],
